### Wolf's Profile (role: villain)
Wolf is an enigmatic predator lurking in the woods, known for his strategic cunning and deceptively charming demeanor. His ageless presence and heightened senses make him a formidable hunter, yet his overconfidence and insatiable greed often lead to impatience. Haunting memories of his pack being decimated by human hunters drive his deep mistrust of humans and justify his manipulative tendencies. His penchant for speaking in riddles keeps others on edge, while his superiority complex blinds him to potential weaknesses. When cornered, his calculated nature can give way to violence, and he won't hesitate to abandon allies if it serves his self-interest.

