The glowing acorn's light pierced through the Woods, casting a warm glow that momentarily dispelled the shadows, infusing the forest with a sense of hopeful magic.
Thunder rumbled ominously in the distance as dark clouds rolled overhead, blanketing the Woods in a tense, electrified stillness. The sudden flash of lightning illuminated the path, urging Red to quicken her pace as the rain began to fall in heavy droplets, merging with the rustling leaves.
